<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lengkapi Data Pelamar - PT Motorsights</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333333;">
    <!-- Preheader: teks ringkas yang tampil di preview inbox -->
    <div style="display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all;">
        Lamaran Anda sudah kami terima. Lengkapi formulir data pelamar sebelum {{data.expires_at}}.
    </div>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #f4f5f7;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                    style="max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;">
                    <!-- Logo -->
                    <tr>
                        <td align="left" style="padding: 28px 32px 12px 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">
                            <a href="https://motorsights.com" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;">
                                <img src="https://motorsights.com/assets/custom/images/motor-sights-international.png"
                                    alt="PT Motorsights" width="180"
                                    style="display: block; width: 180px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0;" />
                            </a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Konten -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 28px 32px 8px 32px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Halo {{data.first_name}},</p>
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                                Terima kasih telah melamar di PT Motorsights. Lamaran Anda sudah kami terima.
                                Sebagai langkah berikutnya, mohon lengkapi formulir data pelamar melalui portal
                                karier resmi kami:
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Tombol -->
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 8px 32px 8px 32px;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                <tr>
                                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#c8102e" style="border-radius: 6px;">
                                        <a href="{{data.applicant_form_url}}" target="_blank"
                                            style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">
                                            Lengkapi Data Pelamar
                                        </a>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Link cadangan: teks dipersingkat, href tetap url lengkap -->
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 8px 32px 20px 32px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #666666;">
                            atau buka:
                            <a href="{{data.applicant_form_url}}" target="_blank"
                                style="color: #c8102e; text-decoration: underline; word-break: break-all;">{{data.applicant_form_display_url}}</a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 0 32px 8px 32px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                                Formulir dapat diisi sampai <strong>{{data.expires_at}}</strong>. Anda bisa menyimpan
                                dan melanjutkan pengisian kapan saja sebelum mengirimkannya.
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                                Jika ada pertanyaan, silakan balas email ini atau hubungi kami di
                                <a href="mailto:{{data.contact_email}}" style="color: #c8102e; text-decoration: none;">{{data.contact_email}}</a>.
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">
                                Salam,<br />
                                <strong>Tim Rekrutmen PT Motorsights</strong>
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 20px 32px 28px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #888888;">
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                                @if(data.company_address)
                                {{data.company_address}} &middot;
                                @endif
                                @if(data.company_phone)
                                {{data.company_phone}} &middot;
                                @endif
                                <a href="https://motorsights.com" target="_blank" style="color: #888888; text-decoration: underline;">motorsights.com</a>
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #666666;">
                                Motorsights tidak pernah memungut biaya apa pun dalam proses rekrutmen.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>

</html>
